# Root for bulk experiment data (datasets, embeddings, checkpoints).
# A native Linux path (WSL ext4), not /mnt/c: the M5 data is ~24 GB and is
# streamed. The GTX 1060 machine used a second drive, /mnt/d (0009 §1);
# the RTX 5070 one uses ~/yts-experiments (docs/decisions/0016).
YTS_EXPERIMENT_DATA=/home/<user>/yts-experiments
